2026-08-31T14:54Z claude note upstream v1.12.0 (2026-08-31) bears on the staleness class here: #39 makes a full-text crawl throttle itself and back off when the desktop local API degrades, and #37 refuses the pass entirely under Electron. A build that refuses or throttles leaves older extractor output in place for longer, which is this ticket's class rather than cache loss. Re-derive against v1.12.0

